%PreformattedPara
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 6 209 Tm /F2 9.5 Tf 11.5 TL (# pip install openai      \(needs an API key:  export OPENAI_API_KEY="sk-..."\)) Tj T* (# NOTE: the original GPT-3 engines \(text-davinci-003 etc.\) have been retired by OpenAI,) Tj T* (# so a current GPT-3.5/GPT-4 family model name is used with the same openai library.) Tj T* (import os) Tj T* (from openai import OpenAI) Tj T*  T* (client = OpenAI\(api_key=os.environ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]\)) Tj T*  T* (prompt = "Write a short paragraph about the importance of natural language processing.") Tj T*  T* (response = client.chat.completions.create\() Tj T* (    model="gpt-3.5-turbo",) Tj T* (    messages=[{"role": "user", "content": prompt}],) Tj T* (    max_tokens=120,) Tj T* (    temperature=0.7,) Tj T* (\)) Tj T*  T* (print\("Prompt   :", prompt\)) Tj T* (print\("Response :", response.choices[0].message.content.strip\(\)\)) Tj T* ET
Q
